    POSITIVE fixture for scripts/lint/check-encoder-null-safety.py (#5477).
    The XML-syntax spellings of an OWASP encoder taglib declaration: an
    xmlns binding (urn:jsptld: form) and a jsp:directive.taglib element,
    plus the legacy javax-era URI. The lint MUST report Class D.

    Used only by scripts/lint/test-encoder-null-safety.sh. Not deployed.
